{"5113360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bookish Buddies", "steam_appid": 5113360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cozy game that will ruin your friendships!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of running a peaceful, cute bookstore and cafe with your friends? Well, keep dreaming! <i>Bookish Buddies</i> is a 1-4 player online co-op management and party game. Beneath its adorable low-poly exterior lies pure chaos: flying book boxes, muddy floors, and that one friend who gambles all the store's earnings on the slot machine in the back room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/62481eb3c6dd4515e64274e1618468d5.poster.avif?t=1788014297\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/62481eb3c6dd4515e64274e1618468d5.webm?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/62481eb3c6dd4515e64274e1618468d5.mp4?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the Store (Or Try to)</strong> Brew coffee, organize bookshelves, and try to keep your customers happy. But watch your step! You need to mop up mud, carry heavy physical boxes, and deal with janky physics where one wrong move sends your entire inventory flying across the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork or Pure Sabotage?</strong> Coordination is key to surviving the daily grind. While you are sweating over digital orders and customer reviews, your friend might be running around with a mop, and another might be secretly losing all your hard-earned cash at the Zeus Thunder 1000 slot machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/247ef98fb2be364283c4e36569fc13ca.poster.avif?t=1788014297\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/247ef98fb2be364283c4e36569fc13ca.webm?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/247ef98fb2be364283c4e36569fc13ca.mp4?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 Player Online Co-op:</strong> Run the shop solo or invite your friends for maximum disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Comedy:</strong> From dropping boxes to slipping on wet floors, the ragdoll physics make every mistake hilarious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Secret Back Room:</strong> Will you invest your profits into new furniture, or risk it all on the slot machine?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Management:</strong> Customize your shop, expand your catalog, deal with cargo deliveries, and try not to trip over the sleeping pet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/8bf0bbc828cfe054336f72040eba71da.poster.avif?t=1788014297\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/8bf0bbc828cfe054336f72040eba71da.webm?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/8bf0bbc828cfe054336f72040eba71da.mp4?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cozy game that will ruin your friendships!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of running a peaceful, cute bookstore and cafe with your friends? Well, keep dreaming! <i>Bookish Buddies</i> is a 1-4 player online co-op management and party game. Beneath its adorable low-poly exterior lies pure chaos: flying book boxes, muddy floors, and that one friend who gambles all the store's earnings on the slot machine in the back room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/62481eb3c6dd4515e64274e1618468d5.poster.avif?t=1788014297\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/62481eb3c6dd4515e64274e1618468d5.webm?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/62481eb3c6dd4515e64274e1618468d5.mp4?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the Store (Or Try to)</strong> Brew coffee, organize bookshelves, and try to keep your customers happy. But watch your step! You need to mop up mud, carry heavy physical boxes, and deal with janky physics where one wrong move sends your entire inventory flying across the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork or Pure Sabotage?</strong> Coordination is key to surviving the daily grind. While you are sweating over digital orders and customer reviews, your friend might be running around with a mop, and another might be secretly losing all your hard-earned cash at the Zeus Thunder 1000 slot machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/247ef98fb2be364283c4e36569fc13ca.poster.avif?t=1788014297\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/247ef98fb2be364283c4e36569fc13ca.webm?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/247ef98fb2be364283c4e36569fc13ca.mp4?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 Player Online Co-op:</strong> Run the shop solo or invite your friends for maximum disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Comedy:</strong> From dropping boxes to slipping on wet floors, the ragdoll physics make every mistake hilarious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Secret Back Room:</strong> Will you invest your profits into new furniture, or risk it all on the slot machine?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Management:</strong> Customize your shop, expand your catalog, deal with cargo deliveries, and try not to trip over the sleeping pet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/8bf0bbc828cfe054336f72040eba71da.poster.avif?t=1788014297\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/8bf0bbc828cfe054336f72040eba71da.webm?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5113360/extras/8bf0bbc828cfe054336f72040eba71da.mp4?t=1788014297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_descript